flowchart LR
    A[Choose repository] --> B[Prepare snapshot]
    B --> C{Search mode}
    C -- Natural-language --> D[Semantic candidates]
    C -- Exact-text --> E[Literal matches]
    D --> F[Open real source lines]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Explore files / symbols / map]
    G --> H{Enough evidence?}
    H -- No --> C
    H -- Yes --> I[Developer reaches conclusion]
